					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							This is actually quite simple. You must also feel quite free not to honor this request. Being as I am trying to get grand master tailor sooner rather than later, I would appreciate any of the following items if you happen upon them (Note: This is if you happen upon them, there is no need to buy them for me or anything) : any hq pelts of cat/wolf/bear, pearls, superb rockhopper hide, flawless rockhopper hide, excellent sabertooth tiger skin, and/or any of the velious skins, furs, or silks. Thank You!
